WEBVTT

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:32.210
It's a quite wonderfully designed animal.

00:00:33.104 --> 00:00:35.302
And I was thinking,
how do I introduce this?

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:39.976
And I thought, well, maybe
that old doggerel by Joyce Kilmer,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.980
you know: "Poems are made by fools
like me, but only God can make a tree."

00:00:45.004 --> 00:00:47.668
And you might say,
"Well, God designed the cow."

00:00:47.692 --> 00:00:49.795
But, of course, God got a lot of help.

00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:53.834
This is the ancestor of cattle.

00:00:53.858 --> 00:00:55.032
This is the aurochs.

00:00:56.739 --> 00:00:58.760
And it was designed by natural selection,

00:00:58.784 --> 00:01:02.211
the process of natural selection,
over many millions of years.